<title>USA: Reptron names Michael Branca CFO.</title>
<headline>Reptron names Michael Branca CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reptron Electronics Inc said on Thursday it appointed Michael Branca Chief Financial Officer effective July 16.</p>
<p>Branca replaces Paul Plante, whom the company recently promoted to chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Previously, Branca served as vice president of business development and fincial operations at Utility Partners LC, a software and consulting services company specializing in applications for the utilities industry.</p>
<p>Reptron manufactures and distributes electronic components and products.</p>
